      "kind": "measurement",
      "subject": "ithano ngiri ithatu",
      "rationale": "Ambage nthĩro ĩrĩ menyo na kũrora rwĩmbo — kĩgeranio kĩa mĩhemba ya heikari."
    },
    {
      "kind": "crux",
      "subject": "האילים",
      "rationale": "Ta 'miathi mĩthiomi' (pillars\/posts) kana 'matu matiganĩte' (jambs) — andũ methanĩrire na kĩhooto kĩa kwaria hĩndĩ ya kĩrĩranĩro kĩa Ambru 40-43."
    },
    {
      "kind": "alternative",
      "subject": "מפו ... מפו",
      "rationale": "Ta 'kuuma harĩ ... kuuma harĩ' — no no tuĩke 'hĩndĩ ĩmwe ... hĩndĩ ĩngĩ' kana 'kũo gũtarĩ ... kũo gũkũ' niĩmbere ya ohere."
    }
  ],
  "translation": "Akĩnjinia nthĩro-inĩ ya heikari, akĩrora ⟨את⟩ miathi ĩrĩa mĩthiomi: ithano ngiri ithatu ginya ithano ngiri ithatu itariũ, na itariũ ya ⟨את⟩ ohere, rĩngi ithano ngiri ithatu itariũ kuuma harĩ, na ithano ngiri ithatu kuuma harĩ kũgũrũkĩra — ũcio nĩyo itariũ ya hema.",
